    <p class="bhd-page__kicker">Where Best Hydrate may fit</p>
    <h2>For prolonged sweating and demanding days</h2>
    <p>Best Hydrate provides fluid, glucose and listed electrolytes when mixed according to the label. That can suit hot work, outdoor labour or other shifts with hours of sweating.</p>
    <p>It cannot make unsafe heat exposure safe. Work-rest schedules, cooling, acclimatization and emergency response remain primary controls.</p>
